# Cloudflare Pages redirects: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# There is deliberately NO single-page-app catch-all (`/*  /index.html  200`).
# Every page on this site is a real file, so an unknown URL should get a real
# 404 (Pages serves /404.html with a 404 status) instead of the homepage with a
# 200. The catch-all created "soft 404s" for search engines and hid missing files.
#
# Short, friendly entry points (handy to read out loud in a classroom):
/app      /pages/home.html  302
/play     /pages/home.html  302
/pages    /pages/home.html  302
/pages/   /pages/home.html  302

